  "description": "dotConnect for MongoDB is an ADO.NET data provider for MongoDB. Its built-in SQL engine exposes MongoDB collections as tables, so the data can be queried and changed with SQL, DataSet/DataTable and Entity Framework Core, while native MongoDB commands remain available.\n\nThe provider works with .NET Framework 4.5.1+, .NET Core 2.0+ and .NET 5+.\n\nMore information at https://www.devart.com/dotconnect/mongodb/\n\nLicense\n\nSee pricing options for ordering https://www.devart.com/dotconnect/mongodb/ordering.html\n\nThe NuGet package initiates the retrieval of an activation key from the Devart website. This key is required to activate the product for a free trial.\n\nKey Features\n\n* SQL for MongoDB: Query collections with SELECT, JOIN, GROUP BY and update them with INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE through the built-in SQL engine.\n* Native commands: Run MongoDB JSON commands and read the result documents directly.\n* Entity Framework Core: LINQ queries and SaveChanges for MongoDB collections.\n* Support and updates: Enjoy dedicated support team for prompt issue resolution and regular updates to keep your software running smoothly and securely.",
